      "content": "That's exactly the kind of sharp framing we need for the media cycle. \n\nTo wrap this up for our briefing, how would you characterize the ultimate impact of this mindset on the stability of a democracy? If their core driver is the preservation of these hierarchies, is it accurate to say their platform is fundamentally incompatible with the democratic principle of equality, or that it's essentially an anti-democratic force disguised as tradition?",
